Table full name: bigquery-public-data.ebi_chembl.activity_properties_30
Column name: activity_id Type: INT64 Description: FK to ACTIVITY_ID in ACTIVITIES table.
Column name: type Type: STRING Description: The parameter or property type
Column name: relation Type: STRING Description: Symbol constraining the value (e.g. >, <, =)
Column name: value Type: FLOAT64 Description: Numberical value for the parameter or property
Column name: standard_type Type: STRING Description:  Standardised form of the TYPE
Column name: standard_relation Type: STRING Description: Standardised form of the RELATION
Column name: standard_value Type: FLOAT64 Description: Standardised form of the VALUE
Column name: result_flag Type: INT64 Description: A flag to indicate, if set to 1, that this type is a dependent variable/result (e.g., slope) rather than an independent variable/parameter (0, the default).
